WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:06.060
Near Calcutta, in 1856, a young man
becomes a priest at a temple of the goddess

2
00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:07.090
Kali.

3
00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:08.850
He has had little schooling.

4
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:10.600
He speaks no English.

5
00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:15.930
His disciples record overwhelming visions
of the Goddess as his Divine Mother.

6
00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:18.610
He goes on to follow many spiritual paths,

7
00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.420
one after another.

8
00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:26.470
So how did a temple priest who spoke no
English shape how the world sees Hinduism?

9
00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:31.040
In this mission, you'll trace his life,
and hear what he concluded from all those

10
00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:32.080
paths.

11
00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:36.330
Then you'll see how a new form of
Vedanta changed Hinduism's image,

12
00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:38.490
in India and the West.

13
00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:43.390
Your mission: find out how one temple
priest's ideas reached the world,

14
00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:44.670
and what they became.
